T*
(   - Using hbar = h / \(2*pi\):) Tj
T*
(   E_n = \(n^2 * h^2\) / \(8 * m * L^2\).) Tj
T*
(   - Energy is strictly quantized into discrete quadratic levels: E1, 4*E1, 9*E1, 16*E1, ...) Tj
T*
