T*
(   - Since the average of sin^2 over full half-cycles is 1/2: A^2 * \(L / 2\) = 1 => A = sqrt\(2 /) Tj
T*
(   L\).) Tj
T*
(   - Normalized wave functions:) Tj
T*
(   psi_n\(x\) = sqrt\(2 / L\) * sin\( n * pi * x / L \). \(Q.E.D.\)) Tj
