(   - Along x-axis: p = p' * cos\(theta\) + p_e * cos\(phi\) => p_e * cos\(phi\) = p - p' * cos\(theta\).) Tj
T*
(   - Along y-axis: 0 = p' * sin\(theta\) - p_e * sin\(phi\) => p_e * sin\(phi\) = p' * sin\(theta\).) Tj
T*
(   - Squaring and adding the momentum equations:) Tj
T*
(   p_e^2 * [ cos^2\(phi\) + sin^2\(phi\) ] = [ p - p' * cos\(theta\) ]^2 + [ p' * sin\(theta\) ]^2) Tj
T*
(   p_e^2 = p^2 - 2*p*p'*cos\(theta\) + p'^2 * [ cos^2\(theta\) + sin^2\(theta\) ]) Tj
T*
(   p_e^2 = p^2 + p'^2 - 2 * p * p' * cos\(theta\).) Tj
T*
(   - Multiply by c^2:) Tj
T*
(   p_e^2 * c^2 = \(h*nu\)^2 + \(h*nu'\)^2 - 2 * \(h*nu\) * \(h*nu'\) * cos\(theta\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Conservation of Relativistic Total Energy:) Tj
T*
(   - h*nu + m_e * c^2 = h*nu' + E_e => E_e = h*\(nu - nu'\) + m_e * c^2.) Tj
T*
(   - Squaring energy:) Tj
T*
(   E_e^2 = p_e^2 * c^2 + m_e^2 * c^4 = [ h*\(nu - nu'\) + m_e * c^2 ]^2) Tj
T*
(   = h^2 * \(nu - nu'\)^2 + 2 * h * \(nu - nu'\) * m_e * c^2 + m_e^2 * c^4.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Equating Expressions for E_e^2:) Tj
T*
(   - \(h*nu\)^2 + \(h*nu'\)^2 - 2*h^2*nu*nu'*cos\(theta\) + m_e^2*c^4 = h^2*\(nu^2 - 2*nu*nu' + nu'^2\) +) Tj
T*
(   2*h*\(nu - nu'\)*m_e*c^2 + m_e^2*c^4.) Tj
T*
(   - Canceling identical terms:) Tj
T*
(   - 2 * h^2 * nu * nu' * cos\(theta\) = - 2 * h^2 * nu * nu' + 2 * h * \(nu - nu'\) * m_e * c^2.) Tj
T*
(   h * nu * nu' * [ 1 - cos\(theta\) ] = \(nu - nu'\) * m_e * c^2.) Tj
T*
(   - Divide both sides by m_e * c * nu * nu':) Tj
T*
(   \(h / \(m_e * c\)\) * [ 1 - cos\(theta\) ] = c * \(nu - nu'\) / \(nu * nu'\) = c / nu' - c / nu.) Tj
T*
(   - Since lambda' = c / nu' and lambda = c / nu:) Tj
T*
(   lambda' - lambda = Delta_lambda = \(h / \(m_e * c\)\) * [ 1 - cos\(theta\) ]. \(Q.E.D.\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
