(   [Problem Statement]: Explain the physical significance of quantum commutation relations. Show that [x, p] = i*hbar and explain why position and momentum cannot be simultaneously diagonalized.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Definition of Commutator:) Tj
T*
(   - In operator algebra, the commutator of two operators A_hat and B_hat is defined as:) Tj
T*
(   [A_hat, B_hat] = A_hat * B_hat - B_hat * A_hat.) Tj
